# Localhost preview — only on request

Use this **only when the user explicitly asks** for web/localhost preview. Not part of the default mobile APK workflow.

1. Serve with **`flutter run -d web-server --web-port=5050 --web-hostname=127.0.0.1`** only (fallback ports OK if busy).
2. **Forbidden:** `flutter run -d chrome`, `flutter run -d edge`, or any flag that opens a system browser.
3. Preview only in **Cursor IDE browser** (`cursor-ide-browser`): navigate/refresh `http://127.0.0.1:5050`.
4. Prefer hot restart / same process if already running; do not spawn extra browser windows.
5. Tell the user the preview URL (default `http://127.0.0.1:5050`).
